'''Sunny Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]]/[[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Blue Ocean]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] gacha events. Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event. [[True Form]] introduced in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] has much higher damage.

