==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Seaside Neneko''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Early Summer Neneko''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to Sunny Neneko's guaranteed [[Critical Hit]], she will be very usable in many early [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] stages, including [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]], making [[CyberFace]] a well for [[Normal Cat Capsule|Normal Tickets]].

Though her 100% crit chance is one-of-a-kind in early game, she becomes outclassed by [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Crazed Moneko]] and [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]] once the player obtains them, due to stronger stats. However, she has one advantage over those units in the form of a much faster foreswing, making her a significantly better counter to [[CyberFace]].

With that being said, as long as she's decently leveled and decently protected during battle, Sunny Neneko can destroy the most difficult Metal enemies, and can be used similarly to [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]]. This is because both Cheerleader and Sunny Neneko have an attack cooldown of twenty seconds; and can be used similarly. With that being said, Cheerleader is immensely better, purely due to the difference in recharge time.

Furthermore, her Single Target and long wait time between attacks can be an annoyance when fighting powerful Metal Enemies, as peons get in the way. It is important to keep her alive in order to have a better chance against such enemies.

As long as there are not too many enemies, or you have decent [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] crowd control from Cats gained from the [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]], she can be a great addition to an anti-Metal lineup, in tandem with Waitress and Crazed Moneko.

==='''True Form'''===
Early Summer Neneko gains a large damage increase. This makes her close to doing the same damage as [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]], although her cooldown remains an issue. However, she has a quick attack animation, allowing her to take care of metal enemies if they happen to get too close, knocking them back or killing them entirely. She can also be used with other critters as a failsafe if they don't crit/get knocked back during their animation. If you want to use your golden catfruit seeds, she will be a good investment.

